# Repo-level ignores for compose builds (api + front)

### OS / editors
.DS_Store
.idea
*.swp
*~

### Git metadata (keep sources; drop history from build context)
.git
**/.git
.gitmodules
.gitlab
.gitlab-ci.yml
.gitpod
.gitpod.yml

### Docs & unrelated
docs
changes
templates
scripts
CODEOWNERS
CONTRIBUTING.md
CHANGELOG.md
DEPLOY.md
LICENSE

### Python junk
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.tox
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/*.sqlite3
api/tests

### Local env & data
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
data
**/data
# Host Typesense *data* directories only — do NOT use a bare "typesense" rule:
# that also excludes api/funkwhale_api/typesense (Django app) from any build
# whose context is the repo root.
/typesense
/data/typesense

### Flutter build artefacts (rebuilt in image)
build
.dart_tool
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
android/.gradle
android/**/build
ios
macos/Flutter/ephemeral
linux/flutter/ephemeral
windows/flutter/ephemeral
flatpak
test
**/*.iml

### Server / docs not needed for front Flutter build
# (front Dockerfile only COPYs Flutter paths; still shrink context)
api
docs
deploy
scripts
templates
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
CODEOWNERS
pyproject.toml
.pre-commit-config.yaml
.flake8
.codespellignore
.yarnrc
.gitpod
.gitpod.yml
.gitlab
.gitlab-ci.yml

### Front leftovers
front/dist
front/node_modules
